/Title (A\040picture\040is\040worth\040a\040thousand\040words\072\040Code\040clone\040detection\040based\040on\040image\040similarity)
/Author (Chaiyong\040Ragkhitwetsagul\054\040Jens\040Krinke\054\040Bruno\040Marnette)
/Subject (This\040paper\040introduces\040a\040new\040code\040clone\040detection\040technique\040based\040on\040image\040similarity\056\040The\040technique\040captures\040visual\040perception\040of\040code\040seen\040by\040humans\040in\040an\040IDE\040by\040applying\040syntax\040highlighting\040and\040images\040conversion\040on\040raw\040source\040code\040text\056\040We\040compared\040two\040similarity\040measures\054\040Jaccard\040and\040earth\040mover\047s\040distance\040\050EMD\051\040for\040our\040image\055based\040code\040clone\040detection\040technique\056\040Jaccard\040similarity\040offered\040better\040detection\040performance\040than\040EMD\056\040The\040F1\040score\040of\040our\040technique\040on\040detecting\040Java\040clones\040with\040pervasive\040code\040modifications\040is\040comparable\040to\040five\040well\055known\040code\040clone\040detectors\072\040CCFinderX\054\040Deckard\054\040iClones\054\040NiCad\054\040and\040Simian\056\040A\040Gaussian\040blur\040filter\040is\040chosen\040as\040a\040normalisation\040technique\040for\040type\0552\040and\040type\0553\040clones\056\040We\040found\040that\040blurring\040code\040images\040before\040similarity\040computation\040resulted\040in\040higher\040precision\040and\040recall\056\040The\040detection\040performance\040after\040including\040the\040blur\040filter\040increased\040by\0401\040to\0406\040percent\056\040The\040manual\040investigation\040of\040clone\040pairs\040in\040three\040software\040systems\040revealed\040that\040our\040technique\054\040while\040it\040missed\040some\040of\040the\040true\040clones\054\040could\040also\040detect\040additional\040true\040clone\040pairs\040missed\040by\040NiCad\056)
/Keywords (20\040Mar\0402018\054\040International\040Workshop\040on\040Software\040Clones\054\040Source\040code\054\040Jaccard\040index\054\040Gaussian\040blur\054\040Similarity\040\050network\040science\051\054\040University\040College\040London)
